      "body": "Delivers the investigation required by issue #6435 (queue task 13792): doc/knowledge-layer-feature-matrix-6435.md\n\n- Method + provenance note and normalized feature vocabulary (sections 1-2)\n- Sourced inventories for Obsidian, Evernote, Notion, OneNote, NotebookLM/Gemini Notebook, Logseq, Joplin, Anytype — primary vendor documentation, observed 2026-11-08; unknowns marked as unknowns (section 3)\n- Open Knowledge recorded as an explicit identity blocker with candidates (section 3.9) — Drew-owned question, not assumed\n- Product x feature matrix (section 4)\n- Findings traced to cluster issues #5837-#5844 with adopt/adapt/reject options, all stated compatibly with the ruled read-authority order object -> user default -> server config -> public (section 5)\n- All five Drew-owned program questions recorded open and unanswered (section 6)\n\nRefs #6435, #5678. Docs-only; no code or tests affected.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796777460&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7887&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7887&signature=243f12923babe2b2eaab9e9564eff58a4507fcb773635ee6bb643a29c8693189\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7887?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- 